### Use with the "REST Client" VS Code extension, or copy into Postman.
@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Readiness
GET {{base}}/ready

### Create
POST {{base}}/api/v1/examples
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111

{
  "name": "Sample record",
  "description": "created from requests.http",
  "status": "draft"
}

### List (paginated + sorted + searched)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/examples?page=1&limit=10&sort=-createdAt&search=Sample

### Get one — paste a real id
GET {{base}}/api/v1/examples/PASTE_ID_HERE

### Update (If-Match carries the version for optimistic locking)
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/examples/PASTE_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: 1

{
  "status": "active"
}

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/api/v1/examples/PASTE_ID_HERE

### Validation failure — expect 400 with a field-level error list
POST {{base}}/api/v1/examples
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}

### Not found — expect 404
GET {{base}}/api/v1/examples/3d0f0b5e-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
